flowchart TD
    D[Train episodes with gold calls] --> SPLIT[Split by case ID before augmentation]
    SPLIT --> H[100 protected holdout episodes]
    SPLIT --> R[Replay gold in independent ToolEnv sessions]
    R --> P[Planner messages and ordered gold tool list]
    R --> C[Caller messages and gold arg/value completion]
    R --> S[Summarizer messages and verified next decision]
    R --> N[Mutate structured values and omit final write]
    N --> V[Verify error, recovery or wrong effect with ToolEnv]
    V --> CN[Caller chosen/rejected and recovery pairs]
    V --> SN[Summarizer chosen/rejected decisions]
    B[Frozen original Qwen3-4B base] --> LP[Independent planner LoRA: SFT]
    B --> LC[Independent caller LoRA: SFT plus ranking]
    B --> LS[Independent summarizer LoRA: next-only SFT plus ranking]
    P --> LP
    C --> LC
    CN --> LC
    S --> LS
    SN --> LS
    LP --> I[One inference base with three role adapters]
    LC --> I
    LS --> I
    H --> E[Evaluate unchanged v8 workflow on holdout]
    I --> E
